warning[R0701] (conservative): the `then` arm of this `if` is empty
--> 10:2: an empty arm runs nothing
  = note: either the arm is missing its logic, or the condition can fold into the arms that remain (an empty `then` inverts to `if not ...`)
  = note: Rime does not read comments — an arm holding only an explanatory comment still counts as empty; drop the arm or suppress with `-- rime: allow(empty-if, ...)`
